<title>USA: Pluma to acquire Frank L. Robinson Co.</title>
<headline>Pluma to acquire Frank L. Robinson Co.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN, N.C. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pluma Inc said on Tuesday that it has agreed to acquire substantially all of the assets of Frank L. Robinson Company, a leading wholesale distributor based in Los Angeles, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to usual and customary closing conditions and is expected to close by November 1, 1997, Pluma, a maker of fleece and active wear, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Frank L. Robinson Co operates two facilities in California and posted $48 million in revenues in 1996.</p>
</text>
